================================================================================
READING:
  - If union_recall >> best_single_recall: ensemble has headroom.
  - If Jaccards are low: gates cover disjoint incorrect-trace pools (v1 #22).
  - If Jaccards are high: gates are redundant; ensembling won't help much.
